@inject Diten.Web.Services.IPermissionSnapshot Perms
@*
    The pack §14 button table for the page's script: action code → may this user see it. The script asks
    window.TraceActions.can('EDITLOT') — it never names a permission key, so a button cannot drift from its key.
    Display only: the service's [HasPermission] stays the authority (UAS-001 §4).
*@
<script id="trace-actions" type="application/json">@Json.Serialize(Diten.Web.Models.Traceability.TraceActions.AllowedFor(Perms))</script>
